- exact cancellation focused streak: 30/30 invocations, exit 0, 1 test each.
- `swift test --skip-build --filter automaticKeepaliveSurvivesLongRekey`: exit 0, 1 test.
- `swift test --skip-build --filter LibSSH2AdapterIntegrationTests`: exit 0, 25 tests.
