I’m changing only the test synchronization: `SuspendingRekeyObserver` will expose a continuation-backed `waitForKeepalivesSent(_:)`, and the test will await those emitted production events before reading counters. This preserves the same semantics and manual-clock control while removing the scheduler-iteration assumption that failed under suite load.
